%
% No-model refusal guard (#506). A probabilistic fact is declared but NO
% probability_model is. Probabilistic inference REQUIRES a declared independence
% or dependency model; with none, the evaluator refuses rather than assuming
% independence over the logic:probability facts.
% Expected: no bindings, status unknown.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/probabilistic-no-model/').
:- probability(ex:rain(ex:today, ex:yes), 0.5).
ex:wet(D, ex:yes) :- ex:rain(D, ex:yes).
?- ex:wet(ex:today, X).
